  "title": "Healthier Chewy Chocolate Chip Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "Classic chocolate chip oatmeal cookies are given a healthier makeover. Carrots are added as a natural sweetener and dried cranberries replace half of the chocolate chips.",
